OL,3,GNEWSAItalian-themed festival applies
OL,4,Afor Richmond event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family-friendly Italian-themed
OL,7,Ffestival could take place in south-west
OL,8,FLondon in June.
OL,10,FSicilian-themed Marzamemi Festival has
OL,11,Fapplied for a three-day event on
OL,12,FRichmond Green from 25 June, offering
OL,13,Flive Italian music, banquets and food
OL,14,Fstalls, cooking workshops, wine
OL,15,Ftasting, craft classes, shopping and
OL,16,Fchildren's activities.
OL,18,FThe plan was welcomed by some but
OL,19,Freceived 45 objections over concerns of
OL,20,Fnoise and restricted access to the
OL,21,Fpark.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
