OL,3,GNEWSAItalian-themed festival applies
OL,4,Afor Richmond event
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvent founder Emily Ceraudo said it
OL,7,Fwould be a "boutique, family-friendly
OL,8,Fcelebration" that supported local
OL,9,Fbusinesses. It was previously held in
OL,10,FOld Deer Park.
